#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The Fabric templates are not installed. Reinstall them from the health page."
msgstr "Vigezo vya Fabric havijasakinishwa. Visakinishe tena kutoka kwa ukurasa wa afya."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The node is already mapped to a device."
msgstr "Nodi tayari imeunganishwa na kifaa."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The node's fabric is not swept by the main poller, so its device could not be polled."
msgstr "Fabric ya nodi haifagiwi na poller kuu, kwa hivyo kifaa chake hakikuweza kukaguliwa."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The device does not exist."
msgstr "Kifaa hakipo."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The device is polled by another poller than the one that sweeps this fabric, so it could not read the fabric cache."
msgstr "Kifaa kinakaguliwa na poller nyingine tofauti na ile inayofagia fabric hii, kwa hivyo haikuweza kusoma hifadhi ya muda ya fabric."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "A device \"%s\" from the %s device template, host name %s, polled by poller %d, with availability checks and SNMP off."
msgstr "Kifaa \"%s\" kutoka kwa kigezo cha kifaa cha %s, jina la mwenyeji %s, kinachokaguliwa na poller %d, huku ukaguzi wa upatikanaji na SNMP vikiwa vimezimwa."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "The %s data query on it, listing the node's ports. It creates no graph and no data source by itself."
msgstr "Hoja ya data ya %s juu yake, ikiorodhesha milango ya nodi. Haiundi grafu wala chanzo cha data peke yake."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "Created by the Fabric plugin for node %s. Its values come from the plugin cache; the host name is a reserved name that is never contacted."
msgstr "Imeundwa na programu-jalizi ya Fabric kwa ajili ya nodi %s. Thamani zake zinatoka kwenye hifadhi ya muda ya programu-jalizi; jina la mwenyeji ni jina lililotengwa ambalo haliwasiliwi kamwe."

#: lib/FabricInput.php
msgid "Name: use 1 to 64 letters, digits, spaces, dots, dashes, or underscores, starting with a letter or digit."
msgstr "Jina: tumia herufi, tarakimu, nafasi, nukta, vistari, au mistari ya chini 1 hadi 64, ukianza na herufi au tarakimu."

#: lib/FabricInput.php
msgid "Backend: choose one of the listed backends."
msgstr "Mfumo wa nyuma: chagua mojawapo ya mifumo ya nyuma iliyoorodheshwa."

#: lib/FabricInput.php
msgid "Poller: choose one of the listed pollers."
msgstr "Poller: chagua mojawapo ya poller zilizoorodheshwa."

#: lib/FabricInput.php
msgid "Poller: only the main poller can sweep a fabric until remote poller support is added."
msgstr "Poller: poller kuu pekee ndiyo inayoweza kufagia fabric hadi usaidizi wa poller ya mbali utakapoongezwa."

#: lib/FabricInput.php
#, php-format
msgid "Sweep Interval: enter whole seconds from %d to %d."
msgstr "Muda wa Ufagiaji: weka sekunde kamili kutoka %d hadi %d."

#: lib/FabricInput.php
msgid "Adapter: enter the local adapter name as the kernel names it, such as mlx5_0."
msgstr "Adapta: weka jina la adapta ya ndani kama kernel inavyoliita, kama vile mlx5_0."

#: lib/FabricInput.php
#, php-format
msgid "Adapter Port: enter the port number of the local adapter, from 1 to %d."
msgstr "Mlango wa Adapta: weka nambari ya mlango wa adapta ya ndani, kutoka 1 hadi %d."

