#: lib/PrivilegeProbe.php
msgid "The sweep runs as root. Run the poller as an unprivileged account with read access to the umad devices through a group."
msgstr "Uchunguzi unaendeshwa kama root. Endesha kichunguzi kama akaunti isiyo na mamlaka maalum yenye ufikiaji wa kusoma vifaa vya umad kupitia kikundi."

#: lib/PrivilegeProbe.php lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "A diagnostics tool has the setuid or setgid bit. The plugin never needs it."
msgstr "Zana ya uchunguzi ina biti ya setuid au setgid. Programu-jalizi haihitaji kamwe."

#: lib/PrivilegeProbe.php
msgid "A diagnostics tool or its directory can be written by an account other than its owner, or by the poller account. Whoever can write it chooses what the poller runs."
msgstr "Zana ya uchunguzi au saraka yake inaweza kuandikwa na akaunti nyingine isiyokuwa mmiliki wake, au na akaunti ya kichunguzi. Yeyote anayeweza kuiandika huchagua kile kichunguzi huendesha."

#: lib/PrivilegeProbe.php
msgid "A umad device is readable or writable by every account, so any local user can query the fabric. Restrict it to a group."
msgstr "Kifaa cha umad kinaweza kusomwa au kuandikwa na kila akaunti, kwa hivyo mtumiaji yeyote wa ndani anaweza kuuliza fabric. Kiwekee mipaka kwa kikundi."

#: lib/PrivilegeProbe.php lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "Unknown warning"
msgstr "Onyo lisilojulikana"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Diagnostics Tools"
msgstr "Zana za Uchunguzi"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute directory, on each poller that sweeps a fabric, holding perfquery, ibnetdiscover, and iblinkinfo. The Debian and Ubuntu packages install them in /usr/sbin. No other program is ever run from it."
msgstr "Saraka kamili, kwenye kila kichunguzi kinachokagua fabric, iliyo na perfquery, ibnetdiscover, na iblinkinfo. Vifurushi vya Debian na Ubuntu huvisakinisha katika /usr/sbin. Hakuna programu nyingine yoyote inayoendeshwa kutoka humo."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Tool Directory"
msgstr "Saraka ya Zana"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Node Name Map"
msgstr "Ramani ya Majina ya Nodi"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Optional absolute path to an infiniband-diags node name map file. Names it supplies are shown only; identity is always the node GUID."
msgstr "Njia kamili ya hiari kuelekea faili ya ramani ya majina ya nodi ya infiniband-diags. Majina inayotoa huonyeshwa tu; utambulisho daima ni GUID ya nodi."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Datagram Timeout"
msgstr "Muda wa Kuisha wa Datagramu"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Milliseconds each management datagram may take before the tools retry it (their -t option)."
msgstr "Milisekunde ambazo kila datagramu ya usimamizi inaweza kuchukua kabla ya zana kuijaribu tena (chaguo lao la -t)."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Command Timeout"
msgstr "Muda wa Kuisha wa Amri"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one tool run may take before it is stopped and recorded as failed."
msgstr "Sekunde ambazo uendeshaji mmoja wa zana unaweza kuchukua kabla ya kusimamishwa na kurekodiwa kuwa umeshindwa."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "KiB one tool run may print. Larger output is discarded and recorded as failed."
msgstr "KiB ambazo uendeshaji mmoja wa zana unaweza kuchapisha. Tokeo kubwa zaidi hutupwa na kurekodiwa kuwa limeshindwa."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Maximum Output"
msgstr "Upeo wa Tokeo"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Sweep"
msgstr "Uchunguzi"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Node Time Budget"
msgstr "Bajeti ya Muda wa Nodi"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one node sweep may spend reading counters. Ports not reached are read in the next cycle."
msgstr "Sekunde ambazo uchunguzi wa nodi moja unaweza kutumia kusoma vihesabu. Bandari ambazo hazikufikiwa husomwa katika mzunguko unaofuata."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Failed ports after which a node sweep stops for this cycle. A port that does not answer costs several seconds."
msgstr "Idadi ya bandari zilizoshindwa ambazo baada yake uchunguzi wa nodi husimama kwa mzunguko huu. Bandari isiyojibu hugharimu sekunde kadhaa."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Node Failure Budget"
msgstr "Bajeti ya Kushindwa kwa Nodi"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Index Down Ports"
msgstr "Orodhesha Bandari Zilizo Chini"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, the Fabric Port data query also lists ports that are down and have no remote end, such as unused adapter ports. Cleared, they are left out until they come up."
msgstr "Ikiteuliwa, hoja ya data ya Bandari ya Fabric pia huorodhesha bandari zilizo chini na zisizo na upande wa mbali, kama vile bandari za adapta zisizotumika. Ikiondolewa uteuzi, huachwa nje hadi zitakaporudi juu."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Sakinusha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Weka Majedwali ya Programu-jalizi Wakati wa Kusakinusha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its fabrics, inventory, and samples. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them; export the inventory first from the Fabric Admin page. The fabric is never contacted either way."
msgstr "Ikiteuliwa, kuondoa usakinishaji wa programu-jalizi huhifadhi fabric zake, orodha ya vifaa, na sampuli. Ondoa uteuzi ili kuondoa usakinishaji kuzifute; hamisha orodha ya vifaa kwanza kutoka ukurasa wa Msimamizi wa Fabric. Mtandao wa fabric hauwasiliwi kamwe kwa njia yoyote."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "The tool directory must be an absolute path of letters, digits, dots, dashes, underscores, and slashes, with no trailing slash."
msgstr "Saraka ya zana lazima iwe njia kamili yenye herufi, tarakimu, nukta, vistari, mistari ya chini, na mikwaju, bila mkwaju wa mwisho."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "The tool directory does not exist or is not a directory."
msgstr "Saraka ya zana haipo au si saraka."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "The tool directory path contains a symbolic link. Enter the real path."
msgstr "Njia ya saraka ya zana ina kiungo cha ishara. Ingiza njia halisi."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "The tool directory is not owned by root."
msgstr "Saraka ya zana haimilikiwi na root."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "The tool directory can be written by its group or by others."
msgstr "Saraka ya zana inaweza kuandikwa na kikundi chake au na wengine."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "A diagnostics tool is not owned by root."
msgstr "Zana ya uchunguzi haimilikiwi na root."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "A diagnostics tool can be written by its group or by others."
msgstr "Zana ya uchunguzi inaweza kuandikwa na kikundi chake au na wengine."

